                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f46db607-626c-3d02-b381-bd5e38116ad1",
                        "entry_id": "27105793-7039-3851-9c97-1ae2883fc9ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. светское злословие, пересуды, сплетни"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3ba78c6-a5c3-4cc5-a6fb-ade271de8ab3",
                                "sense_id": "f46db607-626c-3d02-b381-bd5e38116ad1",
                                "text": "Ну, право, здесь в одни сутки услышишь больше комеражей, чем в круглый год в нашем благочестивом Петербурге, который также не очень забавен — надобно отдать ему эту справедливость."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2413c968-43ad-4ed2-81ca-bcffe5560ef3",
                                "sense_id": "f46db607-626c-3d02-b381-bd5e38116ad1",
                                "text": "Но бедный Тургенев!.. все политические комеражи его остановлены."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1105cd15-ea9f-3efe-a5fb-4f10f08f86a8",
                        "entry_id": "27105793-7039-3851-9c97-1ae2883fc9ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. поступок, происшествие дающее повод к сплетням"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a4fe808-589d-434a-8e45-da2534d93e34",
                                "sense_id": "1105cd15-ea9f-3efe-a5fb-4f10f08f86a8",
                                "text": "Маленький комераж, у кого-нибудь случившийся, делается предметом толков и вырастает в один день до огромных размеров."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f22b330d-74cd-45ce-81e1-14070cdd7d15",
                                "sense_id": "1105cd15-ea9f-3efe-a5fb-4f10f08f86a8",
                                "text": "Даже не происходило в продолжение трёх месяцев ничего такого, что называют в столицах комеражами, что, как известно, для города то же, что своевременный подвоз съестных припасов."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ff3d6561-904c-41bf-9d82-ec43da892f14",
                        "source_entry_id": "27105793-7039-3851-9c97-1ae2883fc9ab",
                        "source_sense_description": "сплетни",
                        "target_lang_word": "tittle-tattle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tittle-tattle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98694c49-c085-37a4-aa19-8c179fdff81d",
                                        "entry_id": "ce16bb4f-42d5-382f-afe9-cd161016f92e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petty, idle gossip."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd030fe6-6c8c-4795-b194-9fe0ff8addb4",
                                                "sense_id": "98694c49-c085-37a4-aa19-8c179fdff81d",
                                                "text": "Every idle Tittle-tattle that went about, Jack was always ſuſpected for the author of it: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ef594ca-a02f-4636-a2bc-9c70f8299639",
                                                "sense_id": "98694c49-c085-37a4-aa19-8c179fdff81d",
                                                "text": "She has trouble enough on her hands, with the affairs of that silly young scapegrace, without being pestered by the tittle-tattle of this place. It is all an invention of that fool, Fribsby."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "464ffac1-e8ea-499c-84a7-94204db9c544",
                                                "sense_id": "98694c49-c085-37a4-aa19-8c179fdff81d",
                                                "text": "And, when rumours about him surfaced in the form of insinuating magazine articles demanding to know why he hadn’t found a wife yet, his wily agent Henry Willson made sure that none of them stuck, even if it meant leaking tittle-tattle about other clients instead."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "954be3b7-dadb-3cf6-b649-b0a3396f20a2",
                                        "entry_id": "ce16bb4f-42d5-382f-afe9-cd161016f92e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An idle, trifling talker; a gossip."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fb66676-5e6a-4a60-addc-3dd89bd86e70",
                                                "sense_id": "954be3b7-dadb-3cf6-b649-b0a3396f20a2",
                                                "text": "If I can once extirpate the race of solid and substantial humdrums, I hope by my wholesome and repeated advices, quickly to reduce the insignificant tittle-tattles and matter-of-fact-men that abound in every quarter of this great city."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tittle-tattle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "317017f2-6701-3543-86ac-e7a8e63ac3c2",
                                        "entry_id": "573f7dd1-65e2-3f59-b8e9-b3ef9caa123c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in gossip."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41fdee76-41a1-458f-8f30-f490b01b30e1",
                                                "sense_id": "317017f2-6701-3543-86ac-e7a8e63ac3c2",
                                                "text": "‘I hope you two have been mewed in with that old pussy long enough. While you’ve been tittle-tattling I’ve been doing, — listen to what this bobby’s got to say.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20634137-7fe2-3131-a100-737c1992f0c1",
                                        "entry_id": "573f7dd1-65e2-3f59-b8e9-b3ef9caa123c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To spread gossip."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "74ca9943-a55b-4c64-a4a8-5580e344e9e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "27105793-7039-3851-9c97-1ae2883fc9ab",
                        "source_sense_description": "сплетни",
                        "target_lang_word": "commérage",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "commérage",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d305ab5d-9574-31ea-90a2-e6c93d8af4a1",
                                        "entry_id": "be929e61-7326-3a6c-9091-0c96071a06ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Propos de commère, babillage d'une personne sur un sujet impliquant souvent une autre personne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0120d41f-8318-4b37-96fd-15d7c6c86daf",
                                                "sense_id": "d305ab5d-9574-31ea-90a2-e6c93d8af4a1",
                                                "text": "A Paris, chaque ministère est une petite ville d’où les femmes sont bannies ; mais il s’y fait des commérages et des noirceurs comme si la population féminine s’y trouvait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ebaa616-3e2e-40d5-8aab-ca1fee011ceb",
                                                "sense_id": "d305ab5d-9574-31ea-90a2-e6c93d8af4a1",
                                                "text": "Le bavardage continue incessant et ne prendra fin que lorsque sonnera l'heure du repas : il faudra alors à regret rentrer chez soi, mais on recommencera le lendemain et toujours on trouvera matière à commérages !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0295d151-625a-4ade-9015-c12dded9dda5",
                                                "sense_id": "d305ab5d-9574-31ea-90a2-e6c93d8af4a1",
                                                "text": "Le repas ne fut qu’une longue discussion agricole coupée d’histoires comiques et de commérages sans malice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "daf168de-8964-4d6f-b3ed-e7b8c5077b45",
                                                "sense_id": "d305ab5d-9574-31ea-90a2-e6c93d8af4a1",
                                                "text": "— Mensonges ! s’exclama-t-elle. Commérages de bonne femme ou plutôt non, invention de ta part."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9efbf5ad-d6e2-4f3d-9c4a-e7f8617c288e",
                                                "sense_id": "d305ab5d-9574-31ea-90a2-e6c93d8af4a1",
                                                "text": "Le seul fait qu'il vécût sans compagnie humaine, à cinq ou six kilomètres du pays, offrait déjà une belle source d'inspiration aux commérages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92594ca8-5569-4563-b446-0d427e9c844b",
                                                "sense_id": "d305ab5d-9574-31ea-90a2-e6c93d8af4a1",
                                                "text": "Elle se réjouissait de revoir la ville, Gasbieha, de bavarder, de rire peut-être, d'écouter d'autres histoires que les commérages des femmes de fellahs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b584df9e-d95e-4f03-a28a-9715d5671341",
                        "source_entry_id": "27105793-7039-3851-9c97-1ae2883fc9ab",
                        "source_sense_description": "поступок",
                        "target_lang_word": "discomfiture",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "discomfiture",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "795c705a-5540-3ead-a6b2-1ec78bf9ee47",
                                        "entry_id": "e4089d71-a1b3-306a-b6a8-48124df3692c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Defeat in battle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "242ba24f-db28-3eff-92e2-f0d73f8fee9e",
                                        "entry_id": "e4089d71-a1b3-306a-b6a8-48124df3692c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An emotional state similar to that arising from defeat; frustration, disappointment, perplexity or embarrassment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44ac9e44-fc41-4974-8141-9588eff8bfb0",
                                                "sense_id": "242ba24f-db28-3eff-92e2-f0d73f8fee9e",
                                                "text": "Some of us are concerned because as yet the South shows no penitence. But what exactly do we mean by this? Since down to the close of the war she never confessed any for braving it, the only penitence now left her is that which springs solely from the sense of discomfiture; and since this evidently would be a contrition hypocritical, it would be unworthy in us to demand it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2694516f-c750-4833-8011-51570c246371",
                                                "sense_id": "242ba24f-db28-3eff-92e2-f0d73f8fee9e",
                                                "text": "One of them ended its career as a passenger carrying vehicle in 1907, by freezing in Kemp Town Tunnel, to the discomfiture of some important season ticket holders, who did not hesitate to let the directors know what they thought about the incident."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dee5dd42-3720-420f-9ea7-598c9d282b5f",
                                                "sense_id": "242ba24f-db28-3eff-92e2-f0d73f8fee9e",
                                                "text": "Other countries are not so much angry as avid to exploit the discomfiture of the US or the chaos in the region or both."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
